{
  "hash": 1406835319,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Firing generates Heat equal to the Heat Generated stat. Heat dissipates each second by the displayed Cooling Efficiency value, even while stowed. Reaching 1000 Heat triggers Overheat, forcing a Manual Vent and making the weapon unusable until Heat drops to 150 or below.\n\nManually cancelling a Vent at 125 Heat or below grants 'Dynamic Heat Limiter', decreasing Heat Generation by 50% for 5 seconds. Stowing the weapon removes the buff.\n\nGaining the buff by cancelling the Vent through reloading or starting a sprint freezes its timer until the next time you fire the weapon, provided you dealt damage with the weapon before starting that Vent.\n\nPrimary Ammo Dynamic Heat Weapons deal increased direct damage based on <link Enemy Rank [#CombatantClassifications] />:\n• Minors: 15%\n• Elites, Minibosses, Bosses, and Vehicles: 38%\n• Players: 2.5%",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T00:05:24.708Z",
      "updatedBy": "StardustD2"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
